              "explanation": "While the unmarked Overworld PNG is a raw 4096x4096 (256x256 tile) dump, human-authored town and dungeon atlas sheets on VGMaps crop the repeating border padding and place callouts or multiple floors on one canvas."
            },
            {
              "question": "What happens during jrpg-parser.js parse if a saved GBA Dawn of Souls forum page (shop.html) is not quarantined during the scan step?",
              "options": [
