                "Because Git repositories cannot store binary PNG files larger than 1,024 pixels wide without corrupting their headers",
                "Because the Godot 4.3 headless importer can only read textures located inside the user Downloads directory on Linux",
                "Because raw reference guides, manuals, and cartridge data are copyrighted third-party material that must remain private",
                "Because the RobOS Knowledge Graph validator rejects any JSON-LD file that is committed to a public Git branch"
              ],
              "answer": "Because raw reference guides, manuals, and cartridge data are copyrighted third-party material that must remain private",
              "explanation": "Keeping ~/Downloads/ff1 private on your local disk lets you study and parse accurate reference material while publishing only clean-room code, facts, and newly generated art."
