              "explanation": "Dawn of Souls changed spell prices (for example, Level 1 CURE costs 50 G instead of 100 G) and replaced Vancian spell charges with MP. Quarantining non-NES files during scan keeps the 1990 NES tables clean."
            },
            {
              "question": "Why do we store all downloaded maps, manuals, and disassemblies in ~/Downloads/ff1 outside the public Git repository?",
