                "Because the Mystic Key is sold in the Coneria Item Shop for 50,000 Gold at the start of the game",
                "Because stepping adjacent to a Mystic Key door in Act I before obtaining the Mystic Key in Elfland wastes turns or stalls a naive chest-seeking AI"
              ],
              "answer": "Because stepping adjacent to a Mystic Key door in Act I before obtaining the Mystic Key in Elfland wastes turns or stalls a naive chest-seeking AI",
              "explanation": "The eastern rooms of the Temple of Fiends are locked behind specialType == locked_door_mystic_key. Marking those chests locked ensures the Act I milestone registry only targets the three accessible chests at (3,3), (2,3), and (4,14)."
            }
          ]
